    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It hurts... the rocks are piercing the flesh... I can almost hear them growing. Why am I still alive?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I'm exhausted. I can't feel my limbs... Run! Run to the east!",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Death awaits in the south. Death awaits in the north. In the west... the mines there are a dead end, just like those in the Far North.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I can run from the Far North... but how do I run from pain?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
