        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is someone there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Distant Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take a look\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Distant Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, please let me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Distant Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can sense that it's only a poor soul who has suffered much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Distant Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Exhausted, dehydrated, starved...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're Infected too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's one of us, comrades!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, save him, just as you saved all of us\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perform your miracle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not a miracle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oripathy is not the main reason for his pain. I can only stop his illness from tormenting him, but I cannot give him food, clean water, or a safe place to sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't perform miracles. I'm not all-powerful. I simply... believe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're always so humble. We understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pious Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can you hear me, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll hold your hand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "'Believe. Believe in our life.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Believe in our body and mind, believe every beat of our heart, believe every inhale and exhale.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Believe that we are the source of all strength.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "No longer will you live in fear of death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The pain brought about by the rapid growth of Originium in his body begins to fade."
    },
    {
        "text": "He can still hear the voices, but he is no longer writhing in pain."
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saved me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "What can I do to repay you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can call me Hierda, like everyone else here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "A miracle\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hierda has once again saved our comrade!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "She saved all of us! With her motherly caress, she takes away our pain!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hierda!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hierda.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pious Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hierda!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Many Voices"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hierda... Hierda.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that is my name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you look like? I can't see you clearly, or any of the others...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your head is wounded. Did you fall and hurt yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe a mild brain hemorrhage is affecting your vision. Don't worry, we can help you walk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then come with us, for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're taking us to a place without pain, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pious Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, as long as you're willing to come with me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
